# OPTIONAL public Spotify developer-app client ID. No client secret is used.
# Without it Spotify is hidden; procedural radio / live radio still work.
VITE_SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=

# Register this exact local redirect in your Spotify developer dashboard:
# http://127.0.0.1:5173/callback   (use 127.0.0.1, not localhost)
# Also register https://YOUR-APP-DOMAIN/callback for a production build.
# Vite embeds VITE_* values in the public bundle; NEVER put a secret here.
# Premium, allowlisted users / Development Mode limits and provider policy review
# apply. See docs/RADIO.md. Authenticated playback is untested without an account.
